      <guid>https://docs-acegreen.web.app/de/company/certifications/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Engagement für internationale Öko-Material-Standards 
    &lt;div id=&#34;engagement-für-internationale-öko-material-standards&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
